cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the associated manuscript."
title: "GPCR SelectivityMap"
abstract: >-
  An open, auditable toolkit for resolving conserved activation state, evolutionary
  organization, receptor-side compatibility, bound-partner association, and
  receptor-only transfer in class A GPCR endpoint structures. The software reports
  structural associations and validation outcomes, not calibrated functional
  G-protein coupling probabilities.
